{"id":"5180","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5180_main_circumhorizontal-arc_photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">环地平弧</span>是一种相当扁平的光谱色弧，会出现在靠近地平线的低空。它的形成是由于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>等高云的冰晶折射阳光，但它仅在光源（例如太阳）仰角大于58°时出现。红色始终处于最上层，光谱中的紫色部分则最靠近地平线。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Paula de Diaz","location":"阿根廷，圣菲，托托拉斯","latitude":"纬度: 32° 35' 15'' S","longitude":"经度: 61° 9' 39'' W","date":"09 December 2016 1138 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.5.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.5.2"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4974_main_circumhorizontal-arc_photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张照片显示了一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">环天弧顶</span>一部分的特写视图，它是由太阳光通过<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>中的冰晶折射而形成的。图片中还有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n<p>当太阳升高超过58°时会出现环天弧顶。它看起来像一个光谱颜色弧，靠近并大致平行于地平线，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">红色始终位于最上方</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">紫色最接近地平线</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Javier Ceberio García","location":"西班牙马德里Casco Histórico de Vallecas","latitude":"纬度: 40° 21' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 36' 15'' W","date":"25 May 2014 1525 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.5.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.5.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5086_main_circumhorizontal-arc_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这张照片显示了一个部分的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">环天弧顶</span>，是因太阳光通过卷云（可能是一个扩散的尾迹）中的冰晶折射而形成的。</p>\n<p>环天弧顶具有较大的半径，因此它们非常平坦，并且位于天空中的低处，与地平线大致平行。它们只发生在太阳高度大于58°的天空中。光谱颜色使得红色始终位于最上方，蓝色/紫色始终最接近地平线。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Cho Ming Cheng","location":"法国戛纳Centre Ville","latitude":"纬度: 43° 33' 10'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 1' 3'' E","date":"26 May 2004 1237 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.5.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.5.2"}]}]}